COMPILATION OF: E48A3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A3

   1 a 0000 E48A3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] CONTROL: the POSITIVE bare-bit test on a
   4 a 0006      STATIC bit, spelled directly (FLTPOLY2 measures this with a
   5 a 0006      %replace'd `true').  The skip byte is the open question:
   6 a 0006      [C112] writes JNZ for the `= 0'b' form, FLTPOLY2 0075 is JP
   7 a 0006      for the bare test, and the EXCLUSIVE-OR family keeps the
   8 a 0006      [C072] CA defect. */
   9 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  10 c 0006   if b then
  11 c 000D      put list('T');
  12 c 0027   else
  13 c 0027      put list('F');
  14 c 003E   stop;
  15 a 0041 end E48A3;

CODE SIZE = 0041
DATA AREA = 0003
FREE SYMS = 38B0
END  COMPILATION
